# Two Federation destroyers on layouts/emitters.jsonc: Venting starts with its engines and life support destroyed, so
# both systems repair and throw a repair spark at one of their target hardpoints every half second, the first at 0.52 s;
# Intact is whole and throws none. Each spark shows for one second.
# Run it with --layout layouts/emitters.jsonc; the layout's header comment has the whole command.
scroll up 20
wait 0.7
shot sparks-1
wait 0.3
shot sparks-2
wait 0.6
shot sparks-3
